# 统一用 LF：避免 Windows 检出时被转成 CRLF，导致「没改却显示已修改」
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须保持 CRLF（LF 会让 goto 标签失效）
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不要做行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary